# Testing

Tests may use mocks; production code may not.

Add tests for: agent startup, missing configuration, greeting, interruption handling, silence timeout, call disconnect, tool input validation, tool success/failure, duplicate tool execution, provider timeout, invalid model output, human handoff conditions, conversation state transitions.

Use unit tests for business logic and integration tests for LiveKit, OpenAI, telephony, database, and external APIs.

Do not claim an integration works solely because mocked tests pass.
